OL,3,GNEWSATeenager has hand in Punch and
OL,4,AJudy's future
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young Punch and Judy performer is one
OL,7,Fof the "professors" bringing less
OL,8,Fviolent adaptations of the traditional
OL,9,Fshow to life across Dorset beaches.
OL,11,FWhen he first saw the puppet show as a
OL,12,Ftwo-year-old, William Vaughan, who
OL,13,Flives near Shaftesbury, said he was
OL,14,F"just falling in love with it".
OL,16,FNow at 16, he now belongs to the Punch
OL,17,Fand Judy Fellowship and is currently
OL,18,Fperforming the show across the county's
OL,19,Fbeaches.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
